        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur SOLSOLCOM, Soleil Single Cylinder Entryset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Soleil Entryset comes packaged as a combo set with a knob for each side of the door and a single cylinder deadbolt. It is a stunning way to add security to your front door. The Soleil Single Cylinder Entryset is made of forged brass and is available in a wide array of finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur SOLSOLCOM Single Cylinder Soleil Entryset:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Soleil Rosette with Soleil Knob and Deadbolt Combo Pack:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Soleil Knob Diameter: 2.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Soleil Knob Projection: 2.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Soleil Rosette Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.125\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-SOLSOLCOM-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262384\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur SOLSOLCOM Entryset Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
